# smart-enter — шаги записи (что показывается — smart-enter.md)
# Этап 1 — умолчание: Smart Enter выключен, Enter — обычный Obsidian.
title Smart Enter | A new line below without splitting the one you are on
open Shopping list.md
caret 1. Buy milk and bread @ and
say Default: Enter splits the line
key Enter
expect 1. Buy milk / 2. and bread / 3. Pick up the parcel

say Smart Enter → on
settings Keyboard
set Smart Enter = on
caret 1. Buy milk and bread @ and
say Enter → a new line below, this one stays whole
key Enter
type Call the vet
expect 1. Buy milk and bread / 2. Call the vet / 3. Pick up the parcel

say Use Shift+Enter instead → on
settings Keyboard
set Use Shift+Enter instead = on
caret 2. Pick up the parcel @ the
say Enter splits as usual
key Enter
expect 1. Buy milk and bread / 2. Pick up / 3. the parcel
caret 1. Buy milk and bread @ and
say Shift+Enter → a new line below
key Shift+Enter
expect 1. Buy milk and bread / 2. / 3. Pick up / 4. the parcel

say Prefix on the new line → None
settings Keyboard
set Prefix on the new line = None
caret 1. Buy milk and bread @ and
say Shift+Enter → the new line starts empty
key Shift+Enter
expect 1. Buy milk and bread /  / 2. Pick up the parcel
